ethod to query the database.\n   ```python\n   results = query_tool.search(query="quantum computing")\n   ```\n4. **Print Results**: To display results in the console, use:\n   ```python\n   query_tool.print_results(results)\n   ```\n5. **Save Results to CSV**: To save the results to a CSV file, specify the file path.\n   ```python\n   query_tool.save_to_csv(results, "output.csv")\n   ```\n\n## Conclusion\nThe ArXiv Query Tool is a powerful resource for researchers looking to streamline their search process. By following this manual, users can efficiently set up the tool and utilize its features to enhance their research experience.\n', 'encoding': 'utf-8', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} 
